{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7bdb5f93ba6090d30f11546b3a7c0a05b024ef0cd984b2e048cbe6b77c22b14e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc7c902347884ed6359613154b7ca1f6848ead5fd13c88e7583f2d9cd5cff08",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n你好呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6705b80ea96029e6f32a5a4edc5d654163f43382c30c12b92b2920951d8387",
      "text": "刚才在咖啡厅喝茶的时候，我看到有人戴着\n我们在CM里宣传的首饰呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5417dc7997dfb48dc22f9332273e3d1a409b8b55509f94c10da1e1143b9dbcdc",
      "text": "在社交平台上也看到了说买了首饰的\n发言。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43c5391558fbc3dfac40846e6689d6ea2c2b613dba9f879495602151c236cd5a",
      "text": "看着大家都很开心的样子，知道我们的心意\n传达到了，我也就放心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e71149d36fdc9071d84d4fb5af9b968a1c40cdb68441eaceaf94fe5b3f9f1c51",
      "text": "能知道买了那款首饰的人们都收获了幸福的\n心情，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e73cd45847859dc14afb39ba702107d0dd77812b2ae12d7544a87063ea61b90",
      "text": "已经传达给\n许多人了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbbdca33011dfe7490ae40538460455ce2b2e83c7b41930c64d0643d9ff88d4d",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d48966f4148975f709d83cbab13d95c0a43ecd835982903e9c5961eadd2d989",
      "text": "……啊，突然联系你真不好意思。\n就是突然想找你聊聊，忍不住就打电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_302_2_3_027_02_09_a:2_3_027_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afeca33360225989be67fef54bb2f41fce708274222b9f7a95b3ddc719be4720",
      "text": "谢谢你听我倾诉。\n那么再见啦，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
